<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-VALENCIA WANT ROMARIO BACK.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VALENCIA WANT ROMARIO BACK.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Spain 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Cup striker Romario is close to returning to Valencia after the appointment of new coach Jorge Valdano, according to Spanish press reports on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are going to give the coach what he wants, and he wants Romario, who belongs to the club,&quot; Valencia president Paco Roig was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>Romario left Valencia earlier this season after repeatedly clashing with Luis Aragones, who resigned as coach two weeks ago. At present, he is on loan to Flamengo.</p>
